"""The review of a Persian (PPIE) narration after the voice: which approved English passage each block tells (alignment), how each word should be
read from the approved text and its meaning alone (expectation), what the voice actually said, heard locally on the original take and slower copies
of it (audio_prep, acoustic), whether the recognizer may decide on its own (validation), and the repair of a word said wrong (correction), voiced
again only when the owner authorizes it (run). Every record of a review lives in its run's folder; no run reads another's."""
